@api = http://localhost:5080
@connectorSecret = dev-connector-secret
@pw = secret123

### Health
GET {{api}}/health

### 1. Create a WhatsApp account (password required, set once)
# @name createAccount
POST {{api}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "provider": "whatsapp", "password": "{{pw}}", "displayName": "Support line" }

### capture id
@accountId = {{createAccount.response.body.id}}

### 2. Subscribe a customer webhook (secret returned once)
POST {{api}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/webhooks
Content-Type: application/json
X-Account-Password: {{pw}}

{ "callbackUrl": "https://webhook.site/your-uuid" }

### 3. Start / resume the connect flow -> QR only if a fresh scan is needed
POST {{api}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/connect
X-Account-Password: {{pw}}

### 3b. Poll QR / status
GET {{api}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/connect
X-Account-Password: {{pw}}

### 4. Send a text message (once status == "connected")
POST {{api}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-Account-Password: {{pw}}

{ "chatId": "491701234567", "text": "Hello from the unified API" }

### 4b. Send media
POST {{api}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-Account-Password: {{pw}}

{ "chatId": "491701234567", "media": { "type": "image", "url": "https://picsum.photos/600", "caption": "hi" } }

### 5. List recent messages  (?direction=inbound|outbound  ?chatId=<jid>  ?take=)
GET {{api}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/messages
X-Account-Password: {{pw}}

### 6. List groups
GET {{api}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/groups
X-Account-Password: {{pw}}

### 7. Log out (ends WhatsApp session, wipes stored credentials)
POST {{api}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/logout
X-Account-Password: {{pw}}

### --- Simulated connector calls (normally the Node service makes these) ---

### Inbound message (Baileys `messages.upsert` payload)
POST {{api}}/api/webhooks/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
X-Connector-Secret: {{connectorSecret}}

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "raw": {
    "key": { "remoteJid": "491701234567@s.whatsapp.net", "fromMe": false, "id": "BAE5TEST01" },
    "messageTimestamp": 1757082000,
    "message": { "conversation": "hi there" }
  }
}

### Connection status update
POST {{api}}/api/internal/whatsapp/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-Connector-Secret: {{connectorSecret}}

{ "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "status": "connected", "externalAccountId": "491701234567@s.whatsapp.net" }

### Connector debug buffer
GET {{api}}/api/whatsapp/debug/events
